            <p class="ctc-gold-deep-text font-body text-xs tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-4">In person</p>
            <p class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed">For people based in Cape Town, I see clients at a private consulting room in Newlands, in the Southern Suburbs. Some people find that a defined place, at a defined time, makes it easier to give the conversation their full attention. Appointments are arranged in advance, and the address is shared privately once one is confirmed.</p>
