        <p class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch] mb-12">
          The first step is a free 15-minute fit call: a short conversation about what is bringing you here and whether my way of working suits what you need. If the issue falls outside my scope, or another kind of support would serve you better, I will say so directly.
