        <div class="pt-10 border-t border-border/60">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl text-foreground mb-5">A contained first piece of work</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed mb-9 max-w-[65ch]">Many people begin with a five-session process. The work moves from clarifying what is actually happening, to identifying what maintains it, to introducing adjustments and testing how they hold, ending with a review of what has shifted.</p>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            {fiveSteps.map((step) => (
