          </div>
          <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed mt-8 max-w-[65ch]">This is a structure, not a promise of resolution in five sessions. Some people come for a focused period; others find a longer relationship useful as different parts of their life connect. <a href="/wisdom/what-happens-in-a-five-session-counselling-process/" class="ctc-inline-link">Read the fuller process overview.</a></p>
          <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed mt-6 max-w-[65ch]">For teenage boys, the starting process includes a parent consultation before work with the young person begins. The <a href="/mentoring-for-adolescents/" class="ctc-inline-link">teenage mentoring page</a> explains that pathway.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

