        </div>

        <div class="font-body text-base text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed space-y-5 max-w-[65ch] mt-10">
          <p>Sessions are usually weekly or fortnightly, depending on what is useful and practical. A limited number of reduced-rate spaces may be available where the standard fee is genuinely prohibitive. If cost is a real barrier, mention it when reaching out and it can be discussed privately.</p>
          <p>Sessions are self-funded and are not submitted directly to medical aid. For parents of teenage boys, the separate parent consultation is R600 for 45 minutes.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- ═══ CTA 5 · the practical decision point ═══ -->
        <div class="mt-12 pt-10 border-t border-border/60">
          <CtaPair placement="after-fees" service={SERVICE} whatsappHref={WHATSAPP} note="Start with the free call, or ask a question first. Either is fine." />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 13 · OTHER PATHWAYS ═══ -->
    <section class="bg-background">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-5xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading ctc-gold-text text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-5">Other ways of working together</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-lg text-foreground/78 leading-relaxed max-w-[65ch] mb-10">I work with adults generally, and have particular experience with boys and young men, and with people involved in contemplative practice.</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
          {supportPaths.map((path) => (
            <a href={path.href} class="group flex flex-col border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-7 bg-card/30 hover:border-primary/60 transition-colors duration-200">
              <h3 class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">{path.title}</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed flex-1">{path.text}</p>
              <span class="ctc-gold-deep-text font-body text-sm mt-5 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-primary/40">Read more &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 14 · SCOPE OF PRACTICE ═══ -->
    <section class="ctc-dark">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-24 max-w-3xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-gold-gradient text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-tight mb-8">Scope of practice</h2>
        <div class="font-body text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6 max-w-[65ch]">
          <p>This is supportive Wellness Counselling under ASCHP registration. It is distinct from clinical psychology, psychotherapy, psychiatry and medical treatment, and it does not include diagnosis of psychiatric conditions or the prescribing of medication.</p>
          <p>There are situations in which specialist psychological, psychiatric, addiction, crisis or medical care is more appropriate, and recognising those limits is part of responsible counselling. Where another form of support would serve you better, I will say so and help you think through a next step. If you need urgent help, or are in immediate danger, please contact an emergency service rather than waiting for a counselling appointment.</p>
          <p class="text-base">Confidentiality, appropriate boundaries and respect for your autonomy are foundational to the process. <a href="/scope/" class="ctc-inline-link">Read the full scope and ethics.</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 15 · FAQ ═══ -->
    <section class="bg-background">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-3xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading ctc-gold-text text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] leading-tight mb-12">Questions before you begin</h2>
        <div class="ctc-faq"><FAQ items={faqItems} /></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ BREAK 03 · Atlantic seaboard at dusk ═══ -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden ctc-graded-dark bg-[hsl(220_26%_8%)]">
      <Image src={capeAtlanticDusk} alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_50%] ctc-kb-img" widths={[640, 1024, 1600]} quality={64} sizes="100vw" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, hsl(220 26% 8% / 0.66), hsl(220 26% 8% / 0.52) 50%, hsl(220 26% 8% / 0.76));"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 py-28 md:py-44 max-w-3xl text-center ctc-reveal">
        <div class="ctc-rule-light w-16 mx-auto mb-8"></div>
        <p class="font-heading ctc-quote-dark text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl italic leading-relaxed">You do not need to know exactly what needs to change before beginning.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══ 16 · FINAL INVITATION AND CALENDAR ═══ -->
    <section id="book-call" class="ctc-warm-bg border-t border-border/50 scroll-mt-[88px]">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-3xl ctc-reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading ctc-gold-text text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[44px] leading-tight mb-10">Start with a conversation</h2>

        <!-- Two clear paths, so a hesitant reader is not funnelled straight into
             a calendar and a ready one is not delayed by anything. -->
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-12">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-primary/40 bg-primary/[0.07] p-7 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">Ready to book?</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed flex-1 mb-6">Choose a time for a free 15-minute fit call in the calendar below. There is no obligation to continue afterwards.</p>
            <a href="#cal-inline-embed" class={primaryButton} data-cta="book-fit-call" data-service={SERVICE} data-placement="closing">Book a free 15-minute fit call</a>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-background/70 p-7 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl text-foreground mb-3">Not ready yet?</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-base text-foreground/75 leading-relaxed flex-1 mb-6">Start a conversation on WhatsApp instead. Ask a question, describe what is going on, or simply see how it feels to write it down.</p>
            <a href={WHATSAPP} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-7 py-4 border border-primary/45 text-foreground/85 hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary/10 transition-colors duration-300 rounded-lg text-sm tracking-wide font-body" data-cta="whatsapp" data-channel="whatsapp" data-service={SERVICE} data-placement="closing">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
              Start a conversation on WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="font-body text-sm text-foreground/65 italic mb-8">In-person appointments in Newlands are arranged after the call, with the location shared privately. In person in Cape Town &middot; Online worldwide.</p>

        <CalEmbed minHeight="640px" service={SERVICE} />
      </div>
    </section>

    <StickyConsultationCTA label="Book a free fit call →" href="#book-call" afterSelector="#the-work" variant="light" service={SERVICE} whatsappHref={WHATSAPP} desktopFloating={true} prominentWhatsapp={true} />
  </div>

  <script>
    // Reveal on scroll, matching /counselling-for-meditators/.
    const revealEls = document.querySelectorAll('.ctc-reveal');
    const reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    if (reduce || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) {
      revealEls.forEach((el) => el.classList.add('ctc-in'));
    } else {
      const io = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries) => {
          entries.forEach((entry) => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.classList.add('ctc-in');
              io.unobserve(entry.target);
            }
          });
        },
        { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -8% 0px' }
      );
      revealEls.forEach((el) => io.observe(el));
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
